{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0032_1001_p", "source_sha256": "135463564f0432a0908f1c38cf1cc79e225403aa4df7a4c5c40c8095cb6adb4d", "ja": "は、肺活……？\nええと、麗花。もう少し詳しく説明を頼む。", "zh": "肺、肺活……？\n呃，丽花，麻烦你再解释得清楚一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
